  "retrieved": "2026-09-21",
  "note": "The published files at designtokens.org are BUNDLES of these sources (the $refs inlined by schemas/scripts/bundle.ts). Validating against the sources plus their three sub-schemas applies exactly the same constraints; ajv resolves the $refs by $id instead of by inlining.",
